    <item>
      <title>小米智能摄像机4Max AI变焦版开售：内置首款AI看护大模型</title>
      <link>https://www.toutiao.com/article/7671452491598365238/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.toutiao.com/article/7671452491598365238/</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <description>今日头条：8月7日小米智能摄像机4Max AI变焦版现货开售，官方定价799元。内置小米首款AI看护大模型，4K双摄、3倍无损变焦，覆盖儿童/老人/宠物看护场景。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>小米主力机型集体涨价 打破行业旧规</title>
      <link>https://www.163.com/dy/article/L3PSEHTG0556BP69.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.163.com/dy/article/L3PSEHTG0556BP69.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <description>网易：8月2日起9款主力机型涨价300-500元，是小米今年第三轮涨价且首次从低端传导至旗舰，冲上微博热搜，舆论两极分化。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>小米汽车“朋友圈”扩大：长城H10接入小米CarloT，SU7高速自动救援</title>
      <link>https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260808A034OQ00?refer=cp_1009</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260808A034OQ00?refer=cp_1009</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <description>腾讯新闻：8月7日长城汽车宣布H10拓展坞首搭小米车端滑轨接口；一辆SU7高速遇险，E-Call系统自动定位拨通120争取救援时间。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>雷军直播拆解新一代SU7：锁单超4万辆，推进“百色计划”</title>
      <link>https://www.aastocks.com/tc/stocks/news/aafn-con/now.1516084/latest-news/aafn</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.aastocks.com/tc/stocks/news/aafn-con/now.1516084/latest-news/aafn</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <description>阿斯达克：雷军在北京亦庄小米汽车工厂直播拆解新一代SU7，称锁单量已超4万辆，将加快交付；并透露小米汽车正做“百色计划”，与专业车漆厂合作推出更多车色。</description>
    </item>
    <item>
